2	//! and turns them into test fixtures. The code is derived from `rust-analyzer`
3	//! and `biome`.
4	//!
5	//! References:
6	//! - <https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-analyzer/blob/e4a405f877efd820bef9c0e77a02494e47c17512/crates/parser/src/tests/sourcegen_inline_tests.rs>
